            '**CPU-only (16 GB system RAM)**: Llama 3.2 3B Q8 (20 tok/sec) or Phi-4 Mini Q4_K_M (25 tok/sec). A used RTX 4060 8GB (~$150) or RTX 5060 Ti 12GB (~$250) is 5-10× faster.',
