            '**RTX 3060 6GB**: Limited to 3B models (Phi-4 Mini, Llama 3.2 3B). Too tight for 7B.',
            '**Best chat model on 12GB:** Llama 3.2 7B at 15–20 tok/sec. Smooth, fast, reliable.',
