      intro: '**As of April 2026, the best local LLMs for business writing are Mistral Small 3.1 24B (most concise, best tone control), Qwen2.5 7B (best non-English business writing), and Llama 3.1 8B (most adaptable to brand voice examples). For business writing, smaller 7B-24B models outperform 70B -- they produce cleaner, more concise output without over-explaining.**',
