          imageCaption: 'Left side (red): Common pitfalls when setting up local writing assistants. Right side (green): Proven solutions. Key mistakes to avoid: using 70B models for fast emails, omitting brand voice examples, trusting unrefined first drafts, ignoring context window limitations, and using one-size-fits-all model configurations.',
